    transformations are recorded in the adjacent PROVENANCE.json.

    AVBD diagonalizes Menagerie's full inertia tensors, omits the gripper, and
    replaces collision meshes with first-party analytic proxies for batched
    Metal contact. The pusher is an independently authored AVBD tool; it is
    not copied from ManiSkill's PandaStick asset.
